decision_conditions:
Condition : 6 - No development shall take place until a Construction Environmental Management Plan (CEMP) covering both the demolition and construction stages has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.  The CEMP shall cover:
(a)	The routeing of vehicles to the site, access and egress arrangements and waiting areas;
(b)	The contractors compound; 
The development shall thereafter be implemented in accordance with the approved details.
